    "collapsible_tabs_i7rBwx": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "question_bmJh66": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is full-spectrum CBD?",
            "answer": "<p>Full-spectrum CBD is a whole-plant hemp extract containing CBD alongside naturally occurring cannabinoids, terpenes, flavonoids, and trace amounts of THC. HempLucid’s full-spectrum formulas are designed for customers seeking a more complete hemp profile rather than CBD alone.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_qmDymB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does HempLucid full-spectrum CBD contain THC?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. HempLucid full-spectrum CBD products contain trace THC levels below 0.3%, alongside CBD and other naturally occurring hemp compounds. Review the product label and batch-specific Certificate of Analysis for the exact cannabinoid profile.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_KDgMmq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will full-spectrum CBD make me feel high?",
            "answer": "<p>Full-spectrum CBD is not intended to create an intoxicating experience when used as directed. However, because it contains trace THC, individual experiences can vary—especially with higher-strength products or greater-than-recommended servings.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_g4RbU6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can HempLucid full-spectrum CBD cause a positive drug test?",
            "answer": "<p>It is possible. Full-spectrum CBD contains trace THC, and repeated use or individual testing factors may lead to a positive result. Customers subject to workplace or athletic drug testing should consider a <a href=\"/collections/thc-free-cbd\" title=\"THC-Free & CBD Isolate\">THC-free HempLucid broad-spectrum or CBD isolate</a> product instead. </p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_n3jn6r": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is full-spectrum CBD different from broad-spectrum CBD and CBD isolate?",
            "answer": "<p>Full-spectrum CBD includes CBD, other hemp-derived compounds, and trace THC. Broad-spectrum CBD keeps a range of cannabinoids and terpenes but is formulated without detectable THC, while CBD isolate contains CBD only.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_gPAgYA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What types of full-spectrum CBD products does HempLucid offer?",
            "answer": "<p>HempLucid offers full-spectrum options in several formats, including MCT oil tinctures, hemp seed oil tinctures, softgels, gummies, water-soluble CBD, body creams, balms, and pet formulas. This makes it easy to choose a format that fits your preferred routine.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_4zr3Hq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does HempLucid test its full-spectrum CBD products?",
            "answer": "<p>All HempLucid extracts and finished product batches are third-party tested at multiple stages for potency and cannabinoid content. Customers can scan the QR code on a product or visit <a href=\"https://lucidlabs.hemplucid.com\" title=\"https://lucidlabs.hemplucid.com\">lucidlabs.hemplucid.com</a> to access its <strong>Certificate of Analysis</strong> and review lab results.</p>",
            "button_txt": "",
            "link": "",
            "onclick": false,
            "onclick_code": "",
            "info": ""
          }
        },
        "question_qMiKPq": {
          "type": "question",
